# Build context hygiene for native/Dockerfile (context = stand-ui/).
# Nothing secret or stateful may reach the image (docs/NATIVE_APP_PLAN.md N5:
# the security scan examines the image; .env files and the SQLite DB are
# per-installation state, never build inputs).
node_modules
.next
data
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
.env*
snowflake.log
*.log
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
tsconfig.scripts.tsbuildinfo
